  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5025.02 Inspection. All barges and vessels used as launch platforms for the supervised display of display fireworks shall be open to inspection by the commissioner, the head of the local police and fire department, harbor master having jurisdiction, or to any person delegated by the aforementioned.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5000) #6055, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03\n\nNew. #8117, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRED: 1-10-05\n\nNew. #8261, eff 1-21-05; ss by #9765-A, eff 8-2-10 (from Saf-C 5025.01); ss by #12124, eff 3-6-17",
